{
  "name": "Capture web leads to Google Sheets and alert on Telegram",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Capture web leads → Google Sheets → Telegram\n\n**What this workflow does**\n1. Hosts a form on your own n8n instance.\n2. Normalizes the lead (name, email, phone, message, timestamp).\n3. Appends one row per lead to a Google Sheet.\n4. Sends a Telegram message to your team.\n\n**Setup (3 steps)**\n1. *Web form* — set your own form path and adjust the fields if needed.\n2. *Save lead to Google Sheets* — connect your Google OAuth2 credential and select the spreadsheet and sheet tab.\n3. *Telegram alert* — connect your bot (@BotFather → /newbot) and select the chat.\n\nSheet headers expected: `name`, `email`, `phone`, `message`, `received_at`.\nWhen no node shows a red triangle: **Save → Execute workflow** to test, then **Active**.\n\n**Privacy:** the form collects personal data. Publish a privacy notice and make sure you have a lawful basis before going live (GDPR).\n\nFull setup guide: github.com/mrnpvn/flowkit",
        "height": 500,
        "width": 440,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "3f9a1c62-0d4e-4b7a-8c51-1a2b3c4d5e01",
      "name": "Read me first",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-640, -60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "Tell us what you need",
        "formDescription": "Leave your details and we will get back to you within 24 hours.",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Name",
              "fieldType": "text",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Email",
              "fieldType": "email",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Phone",
              "fieldType": "text",
              "requiredField": false
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Message",
              "fieldType": "textarea",
              "requiredField": false
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "path": "flowkit-lead",
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "id": "3f9a1c62-0d4e-4b7a-8c51-1a2b3c4d5e02",
      "name": "Web form",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [-140, 0],
      "webhookId": "e2b4c7d1-5a63-4f90-b8d2-6c1f0a9e7b3d"
    },
